ource/authority/country/), e.g. \"Belgium\" -> http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL. Names not yet covered by the context fall back to a plain string and should be added to the context/ontology as the source data grows.","required":true,"schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://ogc.hosted.seadots.emodnet-compliant-windfarm"],"effectiveId":"https://schema.org/addressCountry"},{"path":["properties","n_turbines"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet-compliant-windfarm#nTurbines","required":true,"schema_type":"number","sources":["bblocks://ogc.hosted.seadots.emodnet-compliant-windfarm"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet-compliant-windfarm#nTurbines"},{"path":["properties","power_mw"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet-compliant-windfarm#powerMW","required":true,"schema_type":"number","sources":["bblocks://ogc.hosted.seadots.emodnet-compliant-windfarm"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet-compliant-windfarm#powerMW"},{"path":["properties","status"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet/","jsonld_type":"@vocab","description":"Status of the windfarm, as represented in the source data. The EMODnet service uses a controlled vocabulary of five values: Planned, Production, Dismantled, Approved, Construction.","required":true,"schema_type":"string","enum":["Planned","Production","Dismantled","Approved","Construction"],"sources":["bblocks://ogc.hosted.seadots.emodnet-compliant-windfarm"],"effectiveId":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet/"},{"path":["properties","type_inst"],"id":"https://schema.org/additionalType","required":true,"sources":["bblocks://ogc.hosted.seadots.emodnet-compliant-windfarm"],"effectiveId":"https://schema.org/additionalType"},{"path":["properties","updateyear"],"id":"https://w3id.org/ogc/hosted/seadots/emodnet-compliant-windfarm#updateYear","required":true,"schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://ogc.hosted.seadots.emodnet-complia